{"steam_appid":1702390,"steam_name":"Voor De Kroon","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1702390/821109/04182d491d2508a0b50bbf372005f16c096adc6c/1751021525/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782336772","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093688/1abfb454a829fb71423ad6f3d54266d99899a5d3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782336772","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/d7df1a3e33edb84d443db40b0706e1453013fbe3/ss_d7df1a3e33edb84d443db40b0706e1453013fbe3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785358803","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/9cb4d78d687a8d233cbe219b27f840526e1c5ae1/ss_9cb4d78d687a8d233cbe219b27f840526e1c5ae1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785358803","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/d558449a88c2163b55f1428795624dde7629bff7/ss_d558449a88c2163b55f1428795624dde7629bff7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785358803","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/4e9f3cf58c7ad457492b59927523cf72063ea73c/ss_4e9f3cf58c7ad457492b59927523cf72063ea73c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785358803","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/42efc4455204f91fd474e40bebabb674c5a170cd/ss_42efc4455204f91fd474e40bebabb674c5a170cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785358803"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/27d7139dcd1a4a74d7a3531d7d5189b2.avif?t=1785358803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras_big/27d7139dcd1a4a74d7a3531d7d5189b2.avif?t=1785358803 width=800 height=189 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voor de Kroon is an immersive medieval strategy-action game with historically inspired arms and armor. Fight historical battles and command your troops from the front line or the RTS camera. Use the Warforge editor to reshape the entire game and build your own medieval  campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voor de kroon is a medieval wargame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/6be8c07df8f3b1105ae8715d20fada48.poster.avif?t=1785358803\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/6be8c07df8f3b1105ae8715d20fada48.webm?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/6be8c07df8f3b1105ae8715d20fada48.mp4?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for immersive historical battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull back to the RTS camera to maneuver your formations, time your charges and hold your lines. Then drop into third person and fight in the mud alongside your men while the battle decides itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.poster.avif?t=1785358803\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.webm?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.mp4?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Grounded in real medieval warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All arms and armor are drawn from contemporary sources. Helmets, mail and plate, weapons and equipment all belong to the era they represent and are modeled after manuscript and effigy references.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/9b745419522dcd79fa5396efdbe39a0b.poster.avif?t=1785358803\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/9b745419522dcd79fa5396efdbe39a0b.webm?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/9b745419522dcd79fa5396efdbe39a0b.mp4?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anything with the Warforge editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The editors ship inside the game ready to use the moment you launch it. Create units, factions, castles and entire campaigns as easily as laying out a level, then share them on the Steam Workshop or play what the community has already made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/4193a9de63fa27db727cbdaebfedcf2c.poster.avif?t=1785358803\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/4193a9de63fa27db727cbdaebfedcf2c.webm?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/4193a9de63fa27db727cbdaebfedcf2c.mp4?t=1785358803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Friso-Hollandic Wars campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voor de Kroon's first native campaign is a full historical conquest set in the 13th-century Low Countries. Fight as Floris V to avenge your father's death against the Frisians or play the Frisians in their struggle to survive against the feudal lords. It's the first of more official campaigns to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Solo developed with ♥ in The Netherlands</i></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 1600 or intel Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1660 or AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 28 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600x or intel Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2080 series or AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 28 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy","Early Access"],"developers":["Future Minimalism"],"publishers":["Future Minimalism"],"release_date":"9 Dec, 2022"}